@api = http://localhost:5093

### Book a tour of the raptor paddock (it's closed)
POST {{api}}/tours
Content-Type: application/json

{ "guestName": "Lex Murphy", "paddock": "PADDOCK-9" }

### Book a tour of an open paddock
POST {{api}}/tours
Content-Type: application/json

{ "guestName": "Tim Murphy", "paddock": "PADDOCK-1" }

### The OpenAPI contract: check "openapi" version and "deprecated"
GET {{api}}/openapi/v1.json
